# Expo requires a hoisted node_modules.
#
# pnpm's default isolated layout is the reason to use pnpm, and it is also the
# one thing Metro cannot cope with: it crawls its watch roots to build a file
# map, and pnpm's .pnpm store is a symlink forest deep enough that the crawl
# does not finish. The symptom is not an error. It is "Starting Metro Bundler"
# and then nothing, at 0% CPU, forever.
#
# Hoisting gives up per-package dependency isolation across the workspace, which
# is a real cost: a package can now import something it did not declare and the
# build will not stop it. Accepted because the alternative is no mobile app.
node-linker=hoisted
